Description: Utilities for dealing with systemd unit files - Rust source code
 SuperMox's own copy of the Debianized Rust crate "proxmox-systemd". It
 ships the same source as the upstream package but drops the libsystemd
 development dependency, so it can be built and used on a system that
 has no systemd and no libsystemd. A later task replaces the crate's
 libsystemd FFI calls.
